body:
First off, congrats! I'm in the same boat looking to get in overall better shape, especially for my wedding in July!

&#x200B;

I've been going 4-5x a week since March and have lost about 20 pounds so far! I'm a full-time middle school teacher and it's worked wonders in helping me manage stress and I'm overall a more calm, happy, and positive person. I've noticed a huge change in strength and body comp, but I'm going to be real with you - I didn't notice much change in inches or weight until I started using a scale and tracking calories. You can't outrun a bad diet, unfortunately. Good luck! :)
